      "id": "claim_3474e9bc3fd549b0bf1364e6970b40ca",
      "statement": "The starter treats @ulabase/kit as owning HTTP calls, bearer-token persistence, and session logic, and @ulabase/kit-ng as the Angular adapter that exposes RhAuthService, authGuard/publicGuard, and an HTTP interceptor; the Ulabase service API is reached at /auth/*, /token, and /users/me. App code delegates to provideRhAuth, setToken, and auth.api() instead of assembling Authorization headers or persisting tokens itself.",
