      "id": "claim_8de8a29f1bb94cd4bc23f57379cadde9",
      "statement": "appConfig registers the kit with provideRhAuth({ apiBaseUrl: environment.apiUrl, onError: consentsOnError }); the onError hook sees every failure the kit hits including session restoration that no caller awaits, and the starter uses it to set consentsBlocked when a service Guards rule answers 451 so the consents overlay can distinguish blocked from signed-out.",
