      "statement": "Token lifecycle is delegated to the kit: consumeFragmentToken() hands a captured access_token to setToken() and starts silent renewal with scheduleRefresh({ apiBaseUrl }), authenticated calls use auth.api() or the kit interceptor, and when no token is stored checkSession() short-circuits to null without an HTTP call.",
