      "id": "claim_eeeea7ddd8714310b9809b01d3bc2a2c",
      "statement": "OAuth sign-in is a service-hosted browser round trip: oauthUrl(provider) builds GET /auth/oauth/authorize/{provider}?noauthchallenge and OauthButtons renders it as a plain anchor href, the Ulabase service redirects to the provider and back with #access_token in the URL fragment, consumeFragmentToken() stores the token before guards run, and environment.features.oauthProviders must match the providers configured server-side.",
